# Hypercharged supers that ignored their Overcharged* data or card values (bsrl-sim issue #56), a diff on top of
# hyper_piper_bombs.patch.
# hyper.c: my_card_value answers libg's card-value stub (0xb5281c, -1 in this build) from the hypercharge card for the card
#   types whose libg call sites apply it (Frank/Glowy 202, Ash 274, Shelly 166, Rosa 178, Brock 192, Max 193, Gene 194,
#   Lily 197, Gale 200, Barley 201, Angelo 203, Piper 209, Draco 304, Moe 307); the host applies the ones libg never reads:
#   pets (177 Charlie's spiders, 179 Jessie/Juju/Penny pet buffs and the overcharged-pet byte, Penny's Value4 volley, Tick's
#   ownerless head chain), Griff's extra note (295), Lumi's side blasts (303), Colette's spirit hit (180), Berry's extra
#   scoops (273). A Pet form (Kaze's transformed form) takes its brawler's card.
# env.c: El Primo's negative ChargePushback pulls the hit enemies to the landing point; the charge contact applies the
#   skill's OnChargeHitStatusEffect (Trunk); pet tracking and Berry's scoops are called from the tick.
# spawnfix.c: a reason-3 end chains on a recorded hit or ExecuteChainSpecialCase 2 (Bea, Bibi), the hit enemy goes into the
#   children's hit list; Griff's notes return (is_return_parent matches the data's own id; ret_codes.h skin ids).
# superfix_status.c / superfix_cc.c: SameAreaEffectCanNotDamageMs for ChargeSuper (Max); StunTicks areas stun (Mico).
# superfix.c: max_drinks removed (libg throws the drinks through card 193). superfix_items.c: an ownerless expiring pet area
#   takes its dead pet's summoner (Tick).
